  "description": "Call your own API controllers and minimal API endpoints from C# with no URL string at the call site. A source generator reads the endpoint declarations and emits one typed client per controller, with reflection-free JSON codecs, so the route, the verb, the request shape and the response shape cannot drift from the server. Publishes clean under the WASM/AOT trimmer.",
